Yes, see this paper: Chalmers, R. P. ( 2015 ) Extended Mixed-Effects Item Response Models with the MH-RM Algorithm. Journal of Educational Measurement.

This mostly discusses intercept effects and their modeling, though decomposing the latent trait parameters into fixed/random components isn't much different, and instead are used as regression effects that influence each item indirectly through the properties of the theta variables. HTH.

Phil

